SUMMARY:From Tribal Knowledge to Code: Custom Skills for GitHub Copilot Mo
 dernization
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nEvery application contains business
  rules\, architectural patterns\, internal frameworks\, and development st
 andards that generic AI cannot fully understand.\n\nWithout that context\,
  modernization efforts can produce inconsistent results and require signif
 icant manual review.\n\nLearn how GitHub Copilot Modernization custom skil
 ls help organizations bring their institutional knowledge directly into th
 e modernization process.\n\nSee how custom skills can encode business logi
 c\, software factory patterns\, and governance requirements to generate mo
 re consistent\, accurate\, and production-ready outcomes across applicatio
 ns and teams. Through a live demonstration\, you'll see how custom skills 
 transform modernization workflows by turning tribal knowledge into reusabl
 e guidance that scales across projects.\n\nJoin us to learn how to preserv
 e organizational expertise while accelerating application modernization wi
 th AI.\n\nKey Takeaway: Custom skills help organizations modernize faster 
 while ensuring AI-generated changes align with their unique standards\, pr
 actices\, and business requirements.\n\n[eventID:27594]
