SUMMARY:Copilot Dev Camp Summit – Fall Edition 2026
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nCopilot Dev Camp Summit – Fall Ed
 ition 2026 is a global\, community-driven event designed for developers an
 d makers to explore the latest innovations in Microsoft 365 Copilot and ex
 tensibility.\n\nJoin us for a curated set of sessions\, live demos\, and r
 eal-world insights covering topics such as declarative agents\, custom eng
 ines\, and integration patterns—alongside inspiring stories from the com
 munity.\n\nWhether you're building your first Copilot experience or scalin
 g advanced scenarios\, the Summit offers practical guidance\, hands-on lea
 rning\, and opportunities to connect with experts and peers worldwide.\n\n
 [Learn more about Copilot Dev Camp](https://aka.ms/copilotdevcamp)\n\nThis
  session is a part of a series. [Learn more here](https://developer.micros
 oft.com/reactor/series/S-1694/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1694_webpage_reactor)
